ale for Somebody`s Sake: Nursery Rhyme","synopsis":"The only way out of the time loop they're trapped in is to defeat Alice. Hakuno is hesitant, despite knowing how many she's killed before.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/337018/6584404.jpg"},{"title":"No Second Strike: Dead End","synopsis":"Rin gets them ready for the fifth level, where a Berserker wanders. There’s no floor master, but something perhaps much worse.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/337018/6594080.jpg"},{"title":"Golden Theater of the Deranged: Aestus Domus Aurea","synopsis":"A familiar-looking girl also named Hakuno Kishinami appears. Later, Saber tells the male Hakuno that she's ready to take on the Berserker once again.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/337018/6606057.jpg"},{"title":"Infinite Corpses: Unlimited/Raise Dead","synopsis":"Now on the sixth floor, Hakuno and Saber are suddenly attacked by a swarm of beings who look just like Rin and Rani.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/337018/6606058.jpg"}],"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
